---
/**
 * MobileFoundationsSection — Mobile Design Tokens & Material 3 Foundations
 * Zero-padding errors, clean responsive tables and token swatches.
 */
---

<div class="foundations-container" data-platform-target="universal">
  <!-- Section 1: Colorimetría M3 -->
  <section class="spec-card" id="sec-tokens-color">
    <div class="card-header-row">
      <div class="card-badge-icon"><i class="pi pi-palette"></i></div>
      <div>
        <span class="card-eyebrow">FUNDAMENTOS · COLOR</span>
        <h3 class="card-title">1. Paleta Tonal Material 3 & Contratos de Color</h3>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="card-text">
      Nexa Mobile implementa el sistema de color dinámico Material 3 adaptado a la identidad corporativa. Cada superficie calcula su contraste contra el fondo para asegurar cumplimiento WCAG 2.2 AA (mínimo 4.5:1 para texto normal y 3:1 para controles interactivos).
    </p>

    <!-- Color Swatches Grid -->
    <div class="swatches-grid">
      <div class="swatch-item">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background: #2a67d9; color: #ffffff;">#2a67d9</div>
        <div class="swatch-info">
          <span class="swatch-name">Primary (Nexa Blue)</span>
          <span class="swatch-role">Botones CTA, AppBar tint</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="swatch-item">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background: #e8f0fe; color: #174ea6;">#e8f0fe</div>
        <div class="swatch-info">
          <span class="swatch-name">Primary Container</span>
          <span class="swatch-role">Chips activos, selecciones</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="swatch-item">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background: #082846; color: #ffffff;">#082846</div>
        <div class="swatch-info">
          <span class="swatch-name">Brand Navy</span>
          <span class="swatch-role">Identidad corporativa solida</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="swatch-item">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background: #38c8ff; color: #082846;">#38c8ff</div>
        <div class="swatch-info">
          <span class="swatch-name">Brand Celeste</span>
          <span class="swatch-role">Láser escáner y acentos</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="swatch-item">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background: #ffffff; color: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">#ffffff</div>
        <div class="swatch-info">
          <span class="swatch-name">Surface Card</span>
          <span class="swatch-role">Tarjetas, modales, dialogs</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="swatch-item">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background: #0284c7; color: #ffffff;">#0284c7</div>
        <div class="swatch-info">
          <span class="swatch-name">Active Cyan</span>
          <span class="swatch-role">Entregas confirmadas, QR OK</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 2: Tipografía en sp -->
  <section class="spec-card" id="sec-tipografia-sp">
    <div class="card-header-row">
      <div class="card-badge-icon"><i class="pi pi-align-left"></i></div>
      <div>
        <span class="card-eyebrow">FUNDAMENTOS · TIPOGRAFÍA</span>
        <h3 class="card-title">2. Escala Tipográfica en Unidades Escalares (sp)</h3>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="card-text">
      Todo texto móvil se define en <strong>Scale-independent Pixels (sp)</strong> en Jetpack Compose y puntos lógicos en Flutter para respetar el escalado de fuentes del sistema operativo (accesibilidad para baja visión hasta 200%).
    </p>

    <div class="table-responsive-wrapper">
      <table class="metrics-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Rol Tipográfico</th>
            <th>Tamaño (sp)</th>
            <th>Altura de Línea</th>
            <th>Peso</th>
            <th>Uso Canónico en Móvil</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><code>displayLarge</code></td>
            <td><span class="code-pill">32sp</span></td>
            <td>40sp</td>
            <td>800 (Bold)</td>
            <td>KPIs numéricos de bodega y totales de despacho</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>headlineMedium</code></td>
            <td><span class="code-pill">24sp</span></td>
            <td>32sp</td>
            <td>700 (Bold)</td>
            <td>Títulos principales de pantalla y TopAppBar colapsada</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>titleMedium</code></td>
            <td><span class="code-pill">16sp</span></td>
            <td>24sp</td>
            <td>600 (SemiBold)</td>
            <td>Cabeceras de tarjetas de despacho, ítems y clientes</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>bodyLarge</code></td>
            <td><span class="code-pill">15sp</span></td>
            <td>22sp</td>
            <td>400 (Regular)</td>
            <td>Textos de lectura principal, descripciones de ruta</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>bodyMedium</code></td>
            <td><span class="code-pill">13.5sp</span></td>
            <td>20sp</td>
            <td>400 (Regular)</td>
            <td>Subtextos de guía, direcciones y notas de campo</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>labelSmall</code></td>
            <td><span class="code-pill">11sp</span></td>
            <td>16sp</td>
            <td>700 (Bold)</td>
            <td>Chips de estado (EN TURNO, ENTREGADO), badges M3</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 3: Cuadrícula Espacial 8dp -->
  <section class="spec-card" id="sec-cuadricula-8dp">
    <div class="card-header-row">
      <div class="card-badge-icon"><i class="pi pi-th-large"></i></div>
      <div>
        <span class="card-eyebrow">FUNDAMENTOS · ESPACIADO</span>
        <h3 class="card-title">3. Cuadrícula Espacial de 8dp (con medios pasos de 4dp)</h3>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="card-text">
      Todo el espaciado vertical y horizontal sigue múltiplos estrictos de <strong>8dp</strong>, permitiendo 4dp únicamente para ajustes finos de alineación interna en iconos y badges.
    </p>

    <div class="table-responsive-wrapper">
      <table class="metrics-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Token de Espaciado</th>
            <th>Valor (dp)</th>
            <th>Equivalente Compose</th>
            <th>Uso Arquitectónico</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><code>margin.screen</code></td>
            <td><span class="code-pill">16dp</span></td>
            <td><code>Modifier.padding(horizontal = 16.dp)</code></td>
            <td>Márgenes laterales del Scaffold móvil</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>gutter.cards</code></td>
            <td><span class="code-pill">12dp</span></td>
            <td><code>Arrangement.spacedBy(12.dp)</code></td>
            <td>Separación vertical en LazyColumn entre tarjetas</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>padding.card-inner</code></td>
            <td><span class="code-pill">16dp</span></td>
            <td><code>Modifier.padding(16.dp)</code></td>
            <td>Relleno interior de tarjetas de despacho</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>spacing.touch-gap</code></td>
            <td><span class="code-pill">8dp</span></td>
            <td><code>Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(8.dp))</code></td>
            <td>Separación mínima entre botones adyacentes</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 4: Elevaciones M3 -->
  <section class="spec-card" id="sec-elevaciones-m3">
    <div class="card-header-row">
      <div class="card-badge-icon"><i class="pi pi-clone"></i></div>
      <div>
        <span class="card-eyebrow">FUNDAMENTOS · ELEVACIÓN M3</span>
        <h3 class="card-title">4. Elevación Material 3 & Surface Tinting</h3>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="card-text">
      En lugar de sombras pesadas o difusas, la profundidad se comunica a través de <strong>tintado de superficie en color primario azul Nexa (<code>#2a67d9</code>)</strong>, garantizando legibilidad en pantallas AMOLED y bajo el sol.
    </p>

    <div class="elevation-cards-row">
      <div class="elev-item elev-0">
        <span class="elev-level">Nivel 0</span>
        <span class="elev-dp">0dp</span>
        <span class="elev-usage">Fondo Scaffold</span>
      </div>
      <div class="elev-item elev-1">
        <span class="elev-level">Nivel 1</span>
        <span class="elev-dp">1dp - 2dp</span>
        <span class="elev-usage">Tarjetas & Listas</span>
      </div>
      <div class="elev-item elev-2">
        <span class="elev-level">Nivel 2</span>
        <span class="elev-dp">3dp</span>
        <span class="elev-usage">TopAppBar / BottomNav</span>
      </div>
      <div class="elev-item elev-3">
        <span class="elev-level">Nivel 3</span>
        <span class="elev-dp">6dp</span>
        <span class="elev-usage">Snackbars & FAB</span>
      </div>
      <div class="elev-item elev-4">
        <span class="elev-level">Nivel 4</span>
        <span class="elev-dp">8dp - 12dp</span>
        <span class="elev-usage">Bottom Sheets & Diálogos</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<style>
  .foundations-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .spec-card {
    background: var(--nexa-surface-card, #ffffff);
    border: 1px solid var(--nexa-color-border-structural, #e2e8f0);
    border-radius: var(--nexa-radius-card, 16px);
    padding: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    scroll-margin-top: 80px;
  }

  .card-header-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .card-badge-icon {
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--nexa-color-primary-50, #eff6ff);
    color: var(--nexa-color-primary-600, #2a67d9);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 17px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .card-eyebrow {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--nexa-color-primary-700, #1d4ed8);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .card-title {
    font-family: var(--nexa-font-family-display, sans-serif);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--nexa-color-text-primary, #0f172a);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .card-text {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--nexa-color-text-secondary, #64748b);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Swatches Grid */
  .swatches-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .swatch-item {
    border: 1px solid var(--nexa-color-border-default, #e2e8f0);
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--nexa-color-neutral-50, #f8fafc);
  }

  .swatch-color {
    height: 48px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    font-family: var(--nexa-font-family-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
  }

  .swatch-info {
    padding: 8px 10px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .swatch-name {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--nexa-color-text-primary, #0f172a);
  }

  .swatch-role {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--nexa-color-text-secondary, #64748b);
  }

  /* Responsive Table without padding errors */
  .table-responsive-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--nexa-color-border-default, #e2e8f0);
    border-radius: 10px;
  }

  .metrics-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    text-align: left;
    white-space: nowrap;

    th {
      background: var(--nexa-color-neutral-100, #f1f5f9);
      color: var(--nexa-color-text-secondary, #64748b);
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--nexa-color-border-default, #e2e8f0);
      font-size: 11.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    td {
      padding: 11px 14px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--nexa-color-border-subtle, #f1f5f9);
      color: var(--nexa-color-text-primary, #0f172a);
    }

    tr:last-child td {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
  }

  .code-pill {
    font-family: var(--nexa-font-family-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: var(--nexa-color-primary-50, #eff6ff);
    color: var(--nexa-color-primary-700, #1d4ed8);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--nexa-color-primary-200, #bfdbfe);
  }

  /* Elevation Row */
  .elevation-cards-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .elev-item {
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 14px 12px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--nexa-color-border-default, #e2e8f0);
    background: #ffffff;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;

    &:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    &.elev-0 { background: #f8fafc; box-shadow: none; }
    &.elev-1 { background: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08); }
    &.elev-2 { background: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 3px 6px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.10); }
    &.elev-3 { background: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 6px 12px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12); }
    &.elev-4 { background: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.14); }
  }

  .elev-level {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--nexa-color-primary-700, #1d4ed8);
  }

  .elev-dp {
    font-family: var(--nexa-font-family-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--nexa-color-neutral-600, #475569);
  }

  .elev-usage {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--nexa-color-text-muted, #94a3b8);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
</style>
